# NOVA frontend (Vite) ─ copy to `.env` and adjust if needed.
# Origin of the Python backend (FastAPI + LangGraph + Hugging Face + Qdrant).
#
# Local dev (bun run dev):  http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Docker / nginx build:     `/`  → requests stay on the same origin and the
#                           nginx reverse proxy forwards them to FastAPI.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
